#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0054 expect=noViolation domain=ADSL
#note "DISCRIMINATING, the ONE fixture where PMDA-AD0054 and its CDISC twin part company. The twin carries Requirements.Variables.All: [USUBJID] and SKIPS here; PMDA-AD0054 has no such gate, so it EXECUTES and is silent, because the AUTHORED leading conjunct var_exists('USUBJID') folds FALSE on the absent column and kills the AND (EC-53 / Fix #143 safety). MUST be expect=noViolation. If the lane accepts AD0054-F1, THIS is the fixture to re-author."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADSL structure=ADSL
col STUDYID type=Char
col AGE     type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 56
CDISCPILOT01 | 44
